<article class="env-definition" id="07Z9">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/07Z9">Definition <span data-tag="07Z9">15.8.3</span>.</a> Let $R$ be a ring. Let $M$ be a finite $R$-module. Let $k \geq 0$. The <em>$k$th Fitting ideal</em> of $M$ is the ideal $\text{Fit}_ k(M)$ constructed in Lemma <a href="/tag/07Z8" data-tag="07Z8">15.8.2</a>. Set $\text{Fit}_{-1}(M) = 0$. </p>
